---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import ComingSoon from '../components/ComingSoon.astro';
---
<Base title="Odyssey Plan" description="Design 3 versions of your next 5 years with a guided Odyssey Plan. Coming soon from Tian Shi.">
  <ComingSoon
    id="odyssey"
    title="Odyssey Plan"
    lede="Design 3 versions of your next 5 years, then pick the one worth testing."
    bullets={[
      'A guided template for your three 5-year plans',
      'Gut-check gauges: resources, confidence, excitement, and fit',
      'A way to prototype your favorite plan in the next 30 days, cheaply',
    ]}
  >
    <p>
      Instead of hunting for the one right life, you sketch three: the path you're on, the one you'd take
      if that path vanished, and the one you'd live if money and judgment didn't matter. Seeing them side
      by side makes your next move much clearer.
    </p>
    <p class="credit">
      Based on the Odyssey Plan exercise from <cite>Designing Your Life</cite> by Bill Burnett and Dave
      Evans. This is my own version, adapted for nomads and anyone rethinking money and work.
    </p>
  </ComingSoon>
</Base>

<style>
  .credit { font-size: 0.9375rem; color: var(--ink-3); border-left: 2px solid var(--line-strong); padding-left: 0.9rem; }
</style>
